{
    "zh-CN": {
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_NAME": "<color=#B70027>Dante</color>",
        "ROB_NERO_BODY_NAME": "<color=#2150AF>Nero</color>",
        "ROB_VERGIL_BODY_NAME": "<color=#32D2FF>Vergil</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#B70027>Dante</color> 是一位传奇恶魔猎人，使用双枪与剑进行战斗。<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > 黑檀木与白象牙是可靠、稳定的伤害来源。\n\n< ! > 每把 Devil Arm 都有独特的招式组合，尝试配合方向键输入以发挥其最大效用。\n\n< ! > 使用 Trick 取消动作并躲避来袭的攻击。\n\n< ! > Devil Trigger 会带来不可思议的力量。</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SUBTITLE": "传奇恶魔猎人",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_LORE": "你知道，我真的应该在接活儿之前更好地侦察一下。\n\n一个家伙走进我的店，谈论需要消灭的怪物。非常僵硬和刻板，可能是军人。本该是左臂的地方装着霰弹枪。看来是动真格的。\n\n他把一袋钱和一张船票扔在桌子上。这够我潇洒好几个月了！\n\n但我得保持冷静，欲擒故纵。\n\n'长期工作意味着长期报酬。'\n\n'我相信这个会让你改变主意。'\n\n照片落在桌上。显示一个男人被困在……玻璃里？我看不清他的脸，但那挂饰我无论如何都认得。\n\n这家伙做了功课。看来我得登上这艘船了。\n\n'成交。'\n\n现在我得徒步穿越这个星球清理垃圾。\n\n数周的搜索、杀戮、生存。\n\n但我必须找到<color=#32D2FF>他</color>。\n\n工作就是工作，对吧？\n\n<color=#B70027>Let's rock.</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..于是他离开了。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..于是他消失了。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_DEFAULT_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#B70027>默认</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_MASTERY_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#B70027>经典</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_TYPHOON_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#B70027>idk</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_PRESTIGE_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#B70027>尊贵</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_AC_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#B70027>Rebooted</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_DMC2_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#B70027>老兵</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_DMC_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#B70027>El Donte</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SUPER_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#B70027>超级</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_VERGIL_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#32D2FF>Vergil</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_VERGILEX_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#32D2FF>Vergil EX</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_MINECRAFT_SKIN_NAME": "<color=#B70027>Minecraft</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_COMMANDO_SKIN_NAME": "Commando",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_LEON_SKIN_NAME": "Leon",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_DEFAULT_SKIN_DESC": "该幸存者的默认皮肤。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_MASTERY_SKIN_DESC": "本该由我来用光芒填满她漆黑的灵魂！",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_TYPHOON_SKIN_DESC": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_PRESTIGE_SKIN_DESC": "饶了我吧，我干活时绝不会穿白衣服。这种行头还是留到婚礼上穿吧！",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_AC_SKIN_DESC": "这让我成了什么，某种数码恶魔吗？",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_DMC2_SKIN_DESC": "我确实挺喜欢这套衣服，可惜在 Vie de Marli 的那桩委托剩下的部分一言难尽。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_DMC_SKIN_DESC": "叫我 El Donte。恶魔杀手 El Donte。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SUPER_SKIN_DESC": "头盔照亮洞穴的效果非常棒。唯一的毛病是一里开外的敌人全都能看见你。\n\n<color=#B70027>提供无限 Devil Trigger 能量。</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_VERGIL_SKIN_DESC": "为了追寻力量，那个男人达成了一笔终生悔恨的交易。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_VERGILEX_SKIN_DESC": "即便是这颗充斥着无休止纷争的星球，对他们两人来说也显得太过狭小了。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_MINECRAFT_SKIN_DESC": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_COMMANDO_SKIN_DESC": "如果你发现某个 UES 士兵倒在厕所隔间里呼呼大睡还被扒光了护甲，装作没看见走开就好。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_LEON_SKIN_DESC": "伙计，这活儿真够遭罪的。这鬼地方甚至能把恶魔都整哭！",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_PASSIVE_NAME": "<color=#B70027>Son of Sparda</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#B70027>Dante</color> 可以使用若干 <style=cIsDamage>独特能力</style>。<style=cIsUtility>悬停查看更多信息。</style>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_CONFIRM_NAME": "确认",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_CONFIRM_DESCRIPTION": "执行当前技能。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_CANCEL_NAME": "取消",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_CANCEL_DESCRIPTION": "取消当前技能。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_PRIMARY_NAME": "<color=#B70027>Ebony & Ivory</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_PRIMARY_DESCRIPTION": "快速射击造成<style=cIsDamage>120%伤害</style>。停止射击<style=cIsUtility>1秒</style>以准备一个造成<style=cIsDamage>350%伤害</style>的<style=cIsDamage>蓄力射击</style>。",
        "ROB_NERO_BODY_PRIMARY_NAME": "<color=#2150AF>Blue Rose</color>",
        "ROB_NERO_BODY_PRIMARY_DESCRIPTION": "射击两次,分别造成<style=cIsDamage>200%伤害</style>和<style=cIsDamage>350%伤害</style>。",
        "ROB_VERGIL_BODY_PRIMARY_NAME": "<color=#32D2FF>Summon Swords</color>",
        "ROB_VERGIL_BODY_PRIMARY_DESCRIPTION": "火焰光谱剑可造成 <style=cIsDamage>200% 伤害</style>。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_MELEE_NAME": "<color=#B70027>锁定与装弹</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_MELEE_DESCRIPTION": "准备你的<style=cIsUtility>手持武器</style>。<style=cIsDamage>主要攻击</style>变为<style=cIsDamage>近战攻击</style>,持有时敌人的远程攻击会被<style=cIsUtility>格挡</style>。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_UTILITY_NAME": "<color=#B70027>骗术师</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_UTILITY_DESCRIPTION": "向一个方向<style=cIsUtility>骗术师</style>,获得短暂<style=cIsUtility>无敌</style>。<style=cIsUtility>近战命中立即刷新此技能。</style>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_DEVILTRIGGER_NAME": "<color=#A556FF>Devil Trigger</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_DEVILTRIGGER_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#B70027>Hellbent.</color> 激活 <color=#A556FF>Devil Trigger</color>，消耗能量槽以获得暂时的 <style=cIsUtility>护甲</style>、<style=cIsHealing>生命恢复</style> 和 <style=cIsDamage>伤害提升</style>。近战攻击可积攒能量槽。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_DEVILTRIGGER_SCEPTER_NAME": "完美魔人化",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_DEVILTRIGGER_SCEPTER_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#B70027>Hellbent.</color> 激活 <color=#A556FF>Devil Trigger</color>，消耗能量槽以获得暂时的 <style=cIsUtility>护甲</style>、<style=cIsHealing>生命恢复</style> 和 <style=cIsDamage>伤害提升</style>。近战攻击可积攒能量槽。\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTER: 激活期间使用幻影剑摧毁敌人。</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_SDT_NAME": "<color=#B70027>真魔人化</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_SDT_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>按住</style>将量表注入<color=#B70027>真魔人</color>量表。<style=cIsUtility>按住</style>当量表满时释放你的<style=cIsDamage>真正的恶魔形态</style>持续短时间。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_SDT_SCEPTER_NAME": "<color=#B70027>完美真魔人化</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_SDT_SCEPTER_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>按住</style>将量表注入<color=#B70027>真魔人</color>量表。<style=cIsUtility>按住</style>当量表满时释放你的<style=cIsDamage>真正的恶魔形态</style>持续短时间。\n<color=#d299ff>权杖:激活时用幻影剑猛击你的敌人。</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_PISTOL_NAME": "银弹",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_PISTOL_DESCRIPTION": "射击<style=cIsUtility>银弹</style>，造成<style=cIsDamage>800%伤害</style>。 <style=cIsUtility>爆头</style>造成<style=cIsDamage>2x伤害</style>。杀死<style=cIsUtility>重置所有冷却时间</style>。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_PISTOL_SCEPTER_NAME": "金枪",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_PISTOL_SCEPTER_DESCRIPTION": "射出<style=cIsUtility>银弹</style>造成 <style=cIsDamage>800% 伤害</style>。<style=cIsUtility>爆头</style>造成 <style=cIsDamage>2倍伤害</style>。击杀敌人将<style=cIsUtility>重置所有技能冷却时间</style>。\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTER: 造成 9000% 伤害。</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_HOLYCROSS_NAME": "圣火",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_HOLYCROSS_DESCRIPTION": "引动 <color=#FF0033>Providence</color> 的神威，释放出<style=cIsUtility>滔天烈焰</style>，每跳造成 <style=cIsDamage>300% 伤害</style>。最后以造成 <style=cIsDamage>4000% 伤害</style>的超新星爆发收尾。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_LOADOUT_SKILL_MISC": "被动的",
        "ROB_DANTE_DEVILSHRINE_NAME": "夜之神殿",
        "ROB_DANTE_DEVILSHRINE_DESC": "我没有足够的报酬来写这些。",
        "ROB_DANTE_DEVILSHRINE_CONTEXT": "向夜之神殿祈祷",
        "ROB_DANTE_TREASURECHEST_NAME": "宝箱",
        "ROB_DANTE_TREASURECHEST_DESC": "嘿EEEEEEELLLLLLLPPPPP MEEEEEEEE",
        "ROB_DANTE_TREASURECHEST_CONTEXT": "使用钥匙并打开",
        "ROB_DANTEKEYCOST": "万能钥匙",
        "ROB_DANTE_KEYFRAGMENT_NAME": "关键片段",
        "ROB_DANTE_KEYFRAGMENT_DESC": "钥匙的碎片。收集 3 个即可形成一把完整的钥匙。",
        "ROB_DANTE_KEYFRAGMENT_PICKUP": "钥匙的碎片。收集 3 个即可形成一把完整的钥匙。",
        "ROB_DANTE_KEYFRAGMENT_LORE": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_KEY_NAME": "万能钥匙",
        "ROB_DANTE_KEY_DESC": "用于打开<color=#FFFF00>宝箱</color>。这些箱子包含一个 <color=#FF0033> 神圣遗物 </color> 并在 <style=cIsDamage> 固定位置 </style> 每 <style=cIsUtility>fourth</style> 阶段生成。",
        "ROB_DANTE_KEY_PICKUP": "用于打开宝箱。靠近胸部时会发光。",
        "ROB_DANTE_KEY_LORE": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_REBELLION_NAME": "叛乱",
        "ROB_DANTE_REBELLION_DESC": "索德",
        "ROB_DANTE_REBELLION_PICKUP": "索德",
        "ROB_DANTE_REBELLION_LORE": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_TITAN_NAME": "泰坦",
        "ROB_DANTE_TITAN_DESC": "1,000,000,000,000,000,000 岁的 poooncher",
        "ROB_DANTE_TITAN_PICKUP": "。",
        "ROB_DANTE_TITAN_LORE": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_QUEEN_NAME": "女王",
        "ROB_DANTE_QUEEN_DESC": "双巨盾非常适合重击和人群控制。",
        "ROB_DANTE_QUEEN_PICKUP": "一对巨大的巨盾。",
        "ROB_DANTE_QUEEN_LORE": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_MITHRIX_NAME": "密斯里克斯",
        "ROB_DANTE_MITHRIX_DESC": "这",
        "ROB_DANTE_MITHRIX_PICKUP": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_MITHRIX_LORE": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_BROTHERSOUL_NAME": "国王之魂",
        "ROB_DANTE_BROTHERSOUL_DESC": "每次<style=cIsUtility>挥鞭</style>生成一道<style=cIsDamage>月焰之柱</style>，每次<style=cIsUtility>挥剑</style>生成一块<style=cIsDamage>月之碎片</style>，每次<style=cIsUtility>鞭击重摔</style>释放<style=cIsDamage>地面冲击波</style>，每次<style=cIsUtility>冲刺</style>生成 <style=cIsHealing>20% 护盾</style>。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BROTHERSOUL_PICKUP": "将虚无之王的力量视为自己的力量。",
        "ROB_DANTE_BROTHERSOUL_LORE": "",
        "ROB_DANTE_ITEM_EFFECT_TITLE": "加成效果",
        "ROB_DANTE_ITEM_EFFECT_BACKUPMAG": "获得储存额外蓄力射击的能力。",
        "ROB_DANTE_ITEM_EFFECT_BANDOLIER": "弹药包恢复量表。",
        "ROB_DANTE_ITEM_EFFECT_ALIENHEAD": "魔人化消耗更少的量表。",
        "ROB_DANTE_ITEM_EFFECT_BRAINSTALKS": "魔人化激活期间不消耗量表。",
        "ROB_DANTE_ITEM_EFFECT_PURITY": "增加命中时获得的量表。",
        "ROB_DANTE_ITEM_EFFECT_LYSATECELL": "增加最大量表值。",
        "ROB_DANTE_ITEM_EFFECT_LUMINOUSSHOT": "武器拿出时开始充能。收起时重置。",
        "KEYWORD_HELLBENT": "<style=cKeywordName>Hellbent</style><style=cSub><style=cIsUtility>每关一次</style>，当生命值降至 <style=cIsHealth>25% 以下</style>时，填满你的能量槽并免费赋予一次 <color=#A556FF>Devil Trigger</color>。</style>",
        "KEYWORD_SONOFSPARDA": "<style=cKeywordName>Devil Arms</style><style=cSub>特定头目死亡后，其灵魂会转化为可获取的武器。在拔出武器状态下点击疾跑键可在武器间循环切换。</style>\n\n<style=cKeywordName>Speed</style><style=cSub>以不可思议的高速奔跑。战斗中无法激活。</style>\n\n<style=cKeywordName>Air Hike</style><style=cSub>二段跳。</style>\n\n<style=cKeywordName>Enemy Step</style><style=cSub>借助踩踏敌人实现二段跳。</style>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_NAME": "<color=#B70027>Dante (Sin Devil Trigger)</color>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#B70027>Dante</color> 是一位传奇恶魔猎人，使用双枪与剑进行战斗。<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > 黑檀木与白象牙是可靠、稳定的伤害来源。\n\n< ! > 每把 Devil Arm 都有独特的招式组合，尝试配合方向键输入以发挥其最大效用。\n\n< ! > 使用 Trick 取消动作并躲避来袭的攻击。\n\n< ! > Devil Trigger 会带来不可思议的力量。</color>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_SUBTITLE": "传奇恶魔猎人",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_LORE": "你知道，我真的应该在接活儿之前更好地侦察一下。\n\n一个家伙走进我的店，谈论需要消灭的怪物。非常僵硬和刻板，可能是军人。本该是左臂的地方装着霰弹枪。看来是动真格的。\n\n他把一袋钱和一张船票扔在桌子上。这够我潇洒好几个月了！\n\n但我得保持冷静，欲擒故纵。\n\n'长期工作意味着长期报酬。'\n\n'我相信这个会让你改变主意。'\n\n照片落在桌上。显示一个男人被困在……玻璃里？我看不清他的脸，但那挂饰我无论如何都认得。\n\n这家伙做了功课。看来我得登上这艘船了。\n\n'成交。'\n\n现在我得徒步穿越这个星球清理垃圾。\n\n数周的搜索、杀戮、生存。\n\n但我必须找到<color=#32D2FF>他</color>。\n\n工作就是工作，对吧？\n\n<color=#B70027>Let's rock.</color>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..于是他离开了。",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..于是他消失了。",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_PASSIVE_NAME": "<color=#B70027>Son of Sparda</color>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#B70027>Dante</color> 可以使用若干 <style=cIsDamage>独特能力</style>。<style=cIsUtility>悬停查看更多信息。</style>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_CONFIRM_NAME": "确认",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_CONFIRM_DESCRIPTION": "执行当前技能。",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_CANCEL_NAME": "取消",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_CANCEL_DESCRIPTION": "取消当前技能。",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_PRIMARY_NAME": "<color=#B70027>Devil Sword Dante</color>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_PRIMARY_DESCRIPTION": "毁灭性的<style=cIsDamage>三段连击</style>，彻底释放 <color=#B70027>Devil Sword Dante</color> 的<style=cIsDamage>全部威力</style>。",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_SECONDARY_NAME": "<color=#B70027>The Ombra</color>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_SECONDARY_DESCRIPTION": "掌心释放出的<style=cIsDamage>能量冲击波</style>以<style=cIsDamage>惊人力量</style>重击敌人。",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_UTILITY_NAME": "<color=#B70027>Advent</color>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_UTILITY_DESCRIPTION": "以<style=cIsDamage>超高速</style>移动，在<style=cIsUtility>转瞬之间</style>抵达敌人身前。",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_NAME": "<color=#A556FF>Judgement</color>",
        "ROB_SINDANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_DESCRIPTION": "瞬间释放<style=cIsDamage>全部潜能</style>，令周围敌人沐浴在<style=cIsDamage>致命伤害</style>之中。<style=cIsHealth>消耗全部 SDT 能量槽。</style>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPTER_NAME": "<color=#A556FF>Perfect Judgement</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPTER_DESCRIPTION": "瞬间释放<style=cIsDamage>全部潜能</style>，令周围敌人沐浴在<style=cIsDamage>致命伤害</style>之中。<style=cIsHealth>消耗全部 SDT 能量槽。</style>\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTER: 激活期间使用幻影剑摧毁敌人。</color>",
        "ROB_DANTE_WEAPON_REBELLION_NAME": "Rebellion",
        "ROB_DANTE_WEAPON_REBELLION_DESC": "来自 Dante 父亲的纪念之剑。这把魔剑尚未完全觉醒。",
        "ROB_DANTE_WEAPON_QUEEN_NAME": "Queen",
        "ROB_DANTE_WEAPON_QUEEN_DESC": "一对沉重的大盾。",
        "ROB_DANTE_WEAPON_TITAN_NAME": "Titan",
        "ROB_DANTE_WEAPON_TITAN_DESC": "拥有光之力量的拳套，具有压倒性的破坏力。",
        "ROB_DANTE_WEAPON_COLOSSUS_NAME": "Colossus",
        "ROB_DANTE_WEAPON_COLOSSUS_DESC": "为近战而造的 Devil Arm，充满了被封印的巨像之力。<color=#B70027>升级 Titan。</color>",
